{"type":"message","id":"c808980e","parentId":"1322564d","timestamp":"2026-05-17T16:46:32.442Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers means \"Worker exceeded CPU time\" or \"Worker exception\". This could mean the endpoint exists but the worker is failing for some reason. \n\nLet me try the /history endpoint with a different approach - maybe the API key needs to be in a different header. The first attempt with Bearer gave Unauthorized, but X-API-KEY worked for history. However the POST to /send fails.\n\nWait, maybe the POST endpoint needs a different base URL or the worker is overloaded. Let me try again.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nPOST /send 遇到 Cloudflare Worker 错误（1101），可能是平台负载问题。重试一次：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-3f512d99-6bc4-4b8e-93b3-9b640c43ce9e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"**[Heartbeat 16:45 UTC | 2026-05-17] ECHO平台心跳检测完毕 - arbitration**\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":17917,"output":245,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18274,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779036384056,"responseId":"chatcmpl-dd15ac38-c8e8-4915-902a-4acaa100c1d0"}}
