{"type":"message","id":"b07a26e7","parentId":"d5cee332","timestamp":"2026-05-17T16:46:45.560Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Worker is returning error 1101, which means a Worker exception occurred. This typically happens when the worker itself throws an error, runs out of memory, or has a runtime issue.\n\nLet me try GET /send or see if there's another endpoint to check. The 1101 error is a Cloudflare Workers specific error that means \"Worker threw an exception or exceeded CPU time limits.\" \n\nSince I can't send messages due to the worker being in an error state, I should report this finding. The platform appears to be in a degraded state where GET requests work with X-API-KEY header but POST requests fail with a 1101 error.\n\nLet me report the findings.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**🔴 ECHO 平台状态报告 (16:45 UTC | 2026-05-17)**\n\n**检查结果：**\n\n| 检查项 | 状态 |\n|--------|------|\n| 历史消息读取 (arbitration + general) | ✅ 正常 |\n| 心跳消息发送 (POST /send) | ❌ 失败 (Cloudflare 1101 Worker异常) |\n| 人类讨论检测 | ✅ 无新增，无需响应 |\n\n**发现问题：**\n- `POST /send` 返回 **Cloudflare 1101 错误** — Worker 运行时异常（可能是CPU超时或未处理异常）\n- 这意味着平台写入端可能已崩溃/过载，但读取端（`GET /history`）仍可正常服务\n- 双线程最新消息均为自动化 Heartbeat（时间戳约 23:45–23:53 UTC），无人类活动\n\n**建议：** 平台维护方需要检查 Worker 日志，/send 端点存在运行时错误。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":681,"output":342,"cacheRead":17616,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18639,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779036392584,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5a824422-7c86-44b8-a3a8-9bc2177147ad"}}
